{"prefectureId":"25","cities":{"25201":[{"id":"25201:national:3e7beed7e64e","cityId":"25201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「穴太廃寺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/1611"},{"id":"25201:national:337d214e1ae7","cityId":"25201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「石山寺硅灰石」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/1558"},{"id":"25201:national:72fa08acb7df","cityId":"25201","category":"地域","text":"大津市は、滋賀県の南西端に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E6%B4%A5%E5%B8%82&oldid=111382309"}],"25202":[{"id":"25202:national:335b6fe0635d","cityId":"25202","category":"地域","text":"彦根市は、滋賀県の東部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BD%A6%E6%A0%B9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111207086"},{"id":"25202:national:31b2b2b28e3b","cityId":"25202","category":"地域","text":"彦根市域を含む旧・犬上郡は、古より近江国の交通の結節点でした。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%BD%A6%E6%A0%B9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111207086"}],"25203":[{"id":"25203:national:adecb4f0a881","cityId":"25203","category":"地域","text":"長浜市は、滋賀県の湖北地方に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%95%B7%E6%B5%9C%E5%B8%82&oldid=111250792"}],"25204":[{"id":"25204:national:f4d783eafb97","cityId":"25204","category":"地理・自然","text":"近江八幡市は滋賀県の中央部、琵琶湖東岸に位置する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BF%91%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111027565"},{"id":"25204:national:46709b3c3300","cityId":"25204","category":"地域","text":"近江八幡市は、滋賀県中部、琵琶湖東岸（湖東）に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BF%91%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111027565"},{"id":"25204:national:e92d08abacbc","cityId":"25204","category":"地域","text":"近江八幡市は、豊臣秀次が築いた城下町を基礎として、近世は商業都市として発展した。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%BF%91%E6%B1%9F%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%A1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111027565"}],"25206":[{"id":"25206:national:347323702f9d","cityId":"25206","category":"文化・名所","text":"「芦浦観音寺跡」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/3403"}],"25207":[{"id":"25207:national:9d7be1bc2d93","cityId":"25207","category":"地域","text":"守山市は、近畿地方北東部、滋賀県の南西部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%88%E5%B1%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111302078"}],"25208":[{"id":"25208:national:ce728ed6690a","cityId":"25208","category":"地理・自然","text":"栗東市は滋賀県南部の湖南地域に位置する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111410571"},{"id":"25208:national:5698989904a5","cityId":"25208","category":"地理・自然","text":"市域北東部には野洲川が流れ、市西部には草津川が流れる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111410571"},{"id":"25208:national:da7e3d9d75cb","cityId":"25208","category":"歴史","text":"市域は古くから東海道が通る交通の要衝として発展した。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111410571"},{"id":"25208:national:a3bb79e9b56b","cityId":"25208","category":"地域","text":"栗東市は、滋賀県の南部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A0%97%E6%9D%B1%E5%B8%82&oldid=111410571"}],"25209":[{"id":"25209:national:6192150bfde0","cityId":"25209","category":"地理・自然","text":"甲賀市は滋賀県南端部に位置し、南東端は三重県、南西端は京都府と隣接しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B2%E8%B3%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111339228"},{"id":"25209:national:240990715394","cityId":"25209","category":"地理・自然","text":"甲賀市の最高標高地点は鈴鹿山脈に属する雨乞岳です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B2%E8%B3%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111339228"},{"id":"25209:national:e59850d377c4","cityId":"25209","category":"地域","text":"甲賀市は、滋賀県の南東部の甲賀地域にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B2%E8%B3%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111339228"},{"id":"25209:national:ac3e168b28e6","cityId":"25209","category":"地域","text":"甲賀市の市街地は、水口町、甲南町、甲賀町の三地区に分かれています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B2%E8%B3%80%E5%B8%82&oldid=111339228"}],"25210":[{"id":"25210:national:5ca014cfb90f","cityId":"25210","category":"地域","text":"野洲市は、滋賀県南部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%87%8E%E6%B4%B2%E5%B8%82&oldid=111296700"}],"25211":[{"id":"25211:national:7d388cc73e1b","cityId":"25211","category":"地域","text":"湖南市は、滋賀県の南部、甲賀地域に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82&oldid=111246785"},{"id":"25211:national:c690e68ffaaa","cityId":"25211","category":"地域","text":"市域の南部に阿星山系、北部に岩根山系を擁し、中央部を東から西へ野洲川が流れる。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82&oldid=111246785"}],"25212":[{"id":"25212:national:7937c6070114","cityId":"25212","category":"地理・自然","text":"高島市には琵琶湖があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111357337"},{"id":"25212:national:1d605d571111","cityId":"25212","category":"地理・自然","text":"高島市には乙女が池があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AB%98%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111357337"}],"25213":[{"id":"25213:national:548dabd298e5","cityId":"25213","category":"地域","text":"東近江市は、滋賀県の南東部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%B1%E8%BF%91%E6%B1%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111207393"}],"25214":[{"id":"25214:national:1d983c0ea52d","cityId":"25214","category":"地域","text":"米原市は、滋賀県北東部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%B1%B3%E5%8E%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111077545"}],"25383":[{"id":"25383:national:e092ecb958e0","cityId":"25383","category":"地域","text":"日野町は、滋賀県南東部に位置する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%97%A5%E9%87%8E%E7%94%BA+%28%E6%BB%8B%E8%B3%80%E7%9C%8C%29&oldid=111254438"}],"25384":[{"id":"25384:national:9188131d9fe2","cityId":"25384","category":"地理・自然","text":"竜王町には雪野山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%AB%9C%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA&oldid=109405243"},{"id":"25384:national:c608f7f44bfc","cityId":"25384","category":"地理・自然","text":"竜王町には日野川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%AB%9C%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA&oldid=109405243"},{"id":"25384:national:c531879b8f8e","cityId":"25384","category":"地域","text":"竜王町は、滋賀県の琵琶湖東側（湖東地方）にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%AB%9C%E7%8E%8B%E7%94%BA&oldid=109405243"}],"25425":[{"id":"25425:national:1342a065d1dc","cityId":"25425","category":"地理・自然","text":"愛荘町は、滋賀県の湖東地域に位置する。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%84%9B%E8%8D%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108248483"},{"id":"25425:national:11bf1cb74268","cityId":"25425","category":"地域","text":"愛荘町は、滋賀県の東部に位置し、愛知郡に属する町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%84%9B%E8%8D%98%E7%94%BA&oldid=108248483"}],"25441":[{"id":"25441:national:c22278fda564","cityId":"25441","category":"地域","text":"豊郷町は、滋賀県の東部（湖東地方）に位置する犬上郡の町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%B1%8A%E9%83%B7%E7%94%BA&oldid=111313855"}],"25442":[{"id":"25442:national:70f686746f04","cityId":"25442","category":"地域","text":"甲良町は、滋賀県の東部（湖東地域）にある町です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%94%B2%E8%89%AF%E7%94%BA&oldid=110581754"}],"25443":[{"id":"25443:national:333774469455","cityId":"25443","category":"文化・名所","text":"「アケボノゾウ化石多賀標本」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/00004159"}]}}
